{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15521","headline":"宿报恩寺精舍 · 畅当","name":"宿报恩寺精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟梵送沈景，星多露渐光。\n风中兰靡靡，月下树苍苍。\n夜殿若山横，深松如涧凉。\n羸然虎溪子，迟我一虚牀。\n杳杳空寂舍，蒙蒙莲桂香。\n拥褐依西壁，纱灯霭中央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}